his gate.\n\nFix: revert to `total_seconds()` or compare `elapsed >= timedelta(seconds=STALE_GRACE_SECONDS)`.\n\n| Skill | Found | Changed |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | `.seconds` vs 48h constant; consumer `_shrink_allowed` | — |\n| owner-rules | Grace/removal path must match 48h policy | — |\n| settled-check | Not settled; prior code used `total_seconds()` at base | — |",
