nned contract for this gate run.\n\n## What still looks correct\n\n**measured:** `probe_positive is None` with prior `\"negative\"` still preserves negative + grace (`refresh_incomplete=True`) — failed chain read does not undo an earlier chain verdict.\n\n**measured:** Symmetric TMC-false / probe-true dispute path unchanged (`\"positive\"`, disputed).\n\n## Recommendation\n\nRestore chain-wins for **complete** `probe_positive is False` when TMC lists the netuid (negative + `negative_since`), **or** narrow the new dispute branch so it cannot apply when the probe read is complete; optionally set `disputed` while still recording negative/grace if product wants a flag without blocking removal.\n\nNo shell/tests run (review tools only).",
