or redact `*_KEY` / `*_SECRET` / `*_TOKEN` values. |\n\n## Fix direction\nKeep logging the exception; do **not** log raw env values. Use names-only, an allowlist of non-secret vars, or redaction.\n\n**Gate blocking tags:** none (`never-expires`, `overflow`, `aborts-cycle`, `poisons-later-row` do not apply).\n\n---\n\n**Operational note:** The staging snippet you pasted included a live API key value in the config dict. Treat it as compromised: rotate that key and avoid pasting secret values into tickets or chat (name the variable only).\n\nIf you want this re-posted to GitHub, say so and we can retry `post_verdict` or you can paste the block above as the MC comment on `b82cb42`.",
