            "body": "## Head `10bfa73c` — `_eligible_for_removal` grace check\n\n**Change:** `(now - started).total_seconds() >= STALE_GRACE_SECONDS` → `elapsed.seconds >= STALE_GRACE_SECONDS` with `STALE_GRACE_SECONDS = 172800` (48h) at head (**measured** in `internal/subnet_universe.py`).\n\n### What the two comparisons do (deregistered subnet, `probe is False`, valid `negative_since`)\n\nAssume `started = 2026-01-01T00:00:00+00:00` and `now = started + Δ`. **Inferred** from Python `timedelta` semantics: `.total_seconds()` is full span; `.seconds` is `(total // 1 day)` remainder only, always `< 86400`.\n\n| Δ elapsed | Base: `total_seconds >= 172800` | Head: `elapsed.seconds >= 172800` |\n|-----------|----------------------------------|-----------------------------------|\n| **23h** | False (82800) | False (82800) — same |\n| **25h** | False (90000) | False (3600; 1 day + 1h) — same |\n| **47h** | False (169200) | False (82800; 1 day + 23h) — same |\n| **48h** | **True** (172800) | **False** (0; exactly 2 days) |\n| **49h** | **True** (176400) | **False** (3600; 2 days + 1h) |\n\n**Both sides of 24h:** 23h and 25h agree (still below grace). **Both sides of 48h:** 47h agrees; at and after 48h base allows removal, head never reaches `172800` on `.seconds` (max sub-day component is 86399), so head stays **False** for all Δ ≥ 48h.\n\n### Impact (**inferred** from `_compute_membership` / `_shrink_allowed` at head)\n\nRemoval requires `_eligible_for_removal` (**measured** ~L371–372). With this bug, a negative subnet that has satisfied the real 48h grace **never** becomes eligible; membership shrink is blocked (`_shrink_allowed` returns False when a dropped netuid fails eligibility). Stale netuids **never expire** from the published universe; later cycles keep reading prior membership — **poisons-later-row**.\n\nThis is not a cosmetic simplification; it breaks the documented 48h grace path.\n\n### Skills\n\n| Skill | Found | Changed |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | `.seconds` vs `.total_seconds()` at 48h+ | — |\n| owner-rules | 48h grace / membership shrink must remain honest | — |\n| settled-check | No prior decision to use `.seconds` for multi-day grace | — |",
