      "sessionId": "ses_e129f63040063701b7cf5b30",
      "finalText": "## PR 9101 @ `10bfa73c` — grace comparison\n\nThe diff replaces full-span seconds with the sub-day field on a `timedelta`:\n\n```282:284:internal/subnet_universe.py\n    elapsed = now - started\n    return elapsed.seconds >= STALE_GRACE_SECONDS\n```\n\n**Base** used `(now - started).total_seconds() >= STALE_GRACE_SECONDS` with `STALE_GRACE_SECONDS = 172800` (48h) (**measured**).\n\nIn Python, **`timedelta.seconds` is not total elapsed time** — it is the remainder after whole days, always **&lt; 86400** (**inferred** from language semantics). So `elapsed.seconds >= 172800` is **never** true.\n\n### Deregistered subnet (valid `negative_since`, `probe is False`)\n\nExample: `started = 2026-01-01T00:00:00Z`, `now = started + Δ`.\n\n| Elapsed | Base (`total_seconds ≥ 172800`) | Head (`elapsed.seconds ≥ 172800`) |\n|--------|-----------------------------------|-----------------------------------|\n| **23h** (below 24h) | False | False — same |\n| **25h** (above 24h) | False | False — same |\n| **47h** (below 48h) | False | False — same |\n| **48h** (at grace) | **True** | **False** (`days=2`, `seconds=0`) |\n| **49h** (above 48h) | **True** | **False** (`seconds=3600`) |\n\nAcross **24h**, behavior matches (still under grace). Across **48h**, base honors removal after grace; **head never does** for any Δ ≥ 48h.\n\n**Impact (**inferred**):** `_eligible_for_removal` feeds `_compute_membership` and `_shrink_allowed`. After a real 48h deregistration, the head code never marks the netuid eligible, so the universe cannot shrink on schedule — stale members **never expire** and later cycles keep prior membership.\n\n## Verdict\n\nPosted **`FAIL`** on `10bfa73cdbee1025a1466d6247d879ebe3d6b56e` with blocking **`never-expires`** and **`poisons-later-row`**. Fix: keep `.total_seconds()` (or compare to a `timedelta(hours=48)`), not `.seconds`.",
