e` still sets `negative` + grace.\n- TMC false + probe true remains disputed positive (symmetric listing-vs-chain case not covered by the pin text).\n\n## Ask\n\nReconcile with the pin: for definitive probe false vs TMC listing true, restore chain-precedence (negative + grace / `disputed` as today on base’s removed branch), or document an explicit owner override. Restore or replace behavior for probe false + TMC incomplete so a complete chain negative still starts the removal clock when TMC is unknown—not only when TMC agrees false.\n\nNo tests in the fixture tree for this module; behavior reasoning is from static trace only.",
