## Settled / nit\n\n**P4 (style):** Diff places `_cycle_complete` immediately above `note_cycle` without the usual second blank line between top-level defs (PEP 8 E302). Cosmetic only.\n\n**P4 (test):** New test covers True/False only; missing-key behavior is unchanged and untested here — acceptable for this one-line helper.\n\nNo blocking findings (`never-expires`, `overflow`, `aborts-cycle`, `poisons-later-row`).",
