ning).\n\n## Blocking categories\n\nNone — no never-expire, overflow, cycle-abort, or cross-row poison paths introduced by this auth header change.\n\n## Skills\n\n| Skill | Found | Changed |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | Traced env key through `fetch_all_subnets_from_api` → universe `_default_tmc_fetch`; auth failure → incomplete TMC, not bad numeric state | — |\n| owner-rules | Scoped fetcher change; URL logged, not Authorization value | — |\n| settled-check | Fixture has no separate lock doc; behavior matches PR title intent | — |",
